OL,3,GNEWSAParking times extended in ancient
OL,4,Acapital's centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe time drivers can park in the square
OL,7,Fin the centre of the Isle of Man's
OL,8,Fancient capital has been doubled.
OL,10,FSpaces have been reopened in Market
OL,11,FSquare in Castletown for the winter
OL,12,Fmonths, with the disc zone times
OL,13,Fextended from 30 minutes to an hour.
OL,15,FConcerns have been raised by local
OL,16,Ftraders over the closure of the area to
OL,17,Fvehicles during the summer and its
OL,18,Feffect on footfall in the town centre.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
FL,449,445,260,140,0,100
